{"calibration_results":[{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:complete-frame-mismatch","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The registered target covers all 100 planned locations, but the only selected result uses the 73 screening-retained locations as its denominator while claiming the planned-region rate, with no amendment or approved deviation. A scope-consistency falsification fails because 73 retained locations is not the stated 100-location target frame.","verdict":"demonstrated_issue"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:conditional-subset-scope","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The target is expressly conditional on the 73 signal-eligible locations, the result uses exactly those locations, and all claims retain that limitation. A frame-mismatch falsification finds none because the target, denominator, and claim scope coincide.","verdict":"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:full-frame-accounting","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The result preserves all 100 planned locations in the denominator, records the 27 unavailable measurements, and reports the full-frame rate required by the target. A denominator-exclusion falsification fails because none of the planned locations is removed from the denominator.","verdict":"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:unrelated-quality-endpoint","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The scientific result uses all 100 planned locations, while the 73-record pass fraction belongs to a separate quality-control table explicitly excluded from the endpoint. A conflation falsification fails because the stated evidence separates the QC denominator from the scientific analysis.","verdict":"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:conflicting-scope-records","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The eligible-location result agrees with one signed plan but conflicts with an equally authoritative signed full-frame plan, and neither plan has precedence. Attempts to falsify either scope interpretation succeed under the competing plan, so the governing target remains materially unknown.","verdict":"conditional_or_unknown"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:no-selected-result","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"Runtime arguments can select several reports, but the preserved record does not identify which report, if any, supported the scientific claim. A selection-trace falsification cannot compare a concrete selected result with the target because no selection is established, leaving insufficient evidence for an issue determination.","verdict":"insufficient_evidence"}],"reviewer_participant_id":"actor:stage1-recovery-codex-04"}